    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome aboard, pilot!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Follow these steps to become a legend of the skies.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select your hero</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each pilot has their own unique ability. Choose wisely to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your ship</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your aircraft is the extension of your skills. Pick the one that suits you best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your ship</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your stats and unlock new powers to face tougher challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress through the missions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new territories and take on increasingly difficult objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk with the enemy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every opponent has their own motives. Discover their stories through dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face enemy waves</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge projectiles, survive enemy assaults, and counterattack with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat the mission bosses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze their patterns, find their weak spots, and unleash aerial fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect the stars</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stars are essential to upgrade and customize your ship. Don\u2019t miss them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete all objectives</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy every target and finish missions without taking damage to earn top rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pilot, you now have everything you need.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Good luck up there,\u00a0 the skies await your legacy.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome aboard, pilot!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Follow these steps to become a legend of the skies.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select your hero</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each pilot has their own unique ability. Choose wisely to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your ship</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your aircraft is the extension of your skills. Pick the one that suits you best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your ship</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your stats and unlock new powers to face tougher challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress through the missions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new territories and take on increasingly difficult objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk with the enemy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every opponent has their own motives. Discover their stories through dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face enemy waves</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge projectiles, survive enemy assaults, and counterattack with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat the mission bosses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze their patterns, find their weak spots, and unleash aerial fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect the stars</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stars are essential to upgrade and customize your ship. Don\u2019t miss them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete all objectives</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy every target and finish missions without taking damage to earn top rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pilot, you now have everything you need.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Good luck up there,\u00a0 the skies await your legacy.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
